comment.narrative:
Exceeded the end target of 600 ha. The actual (current) achievement in the area afforested (610 ha) is calculated based on the following:


 1 hectare= 100 mx100m= 10,000 square meters.
 The Project does plantation with an area of&nbsp;2 meters by 2 meters&nbsp;in slope or foreshore area.
 10,000 sqm divided by 2m-by-2m plantation= 2500 seedlings/hectare.&nbsp;
 Total seedlings planted: 1,525,200


&nbsp;
